  "body": "While the `next` token is documented to be a valid token[https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-link-rel] when used as the value of the `rel` attribute on `link`, `prev` is not.\r\n\r\nThe `prev` token is documented here though https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#link-type-prev. Was this an oversight or has `prev` been deprecated?",
